---
/**
 * Lucide `arrow-up` icon, inlined.
 *
 * Used as the visual for the Shift modifier inside `<Kbd>` chips so the docs
 * render Shift identically to the desktop app (which uses `<ArrowUpIcon />`
 * from `lucide-react` in packages/desktop/src/components/KbdShortcut.tsx).
 *
 * Source: https://lucide.dev/icons/arrow-up — Lucide is ISC-licensed.
 */
---

<svg
  xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
  width="10"
  height="10"
  viewBox="0 0 24 24"
  fill="none"
  stroke="currentColor"
  stroke-width="2.5"
  stroke-linecap="round"
  stroke-linejoin="round"
  aria-hidden="true"
  class="doc-kbd-icon"
>
  <path d="m5 12 7-7 7 7"></path>
  <path d="M12 19V5"></path>
</svg>
